cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "QM Air Quality Network Data: 14 months of raw multi-tier air-quality measurements from a low-cost IoT network in London"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
abstract: "Fourteen months (16 April 2025 to 10 June 2026) of raw measurements from seven identical low-cost IoT air-quality nodes at Queen Mary University of London (Mile End campus) and King Edward Memorial Park, London: three indoor-outdoor pairs and two nodes that also carry mid-cost Alphasense electrochemical sensors, together with the co-located NO2 and PM2.5 records of the London Air Quality Network stations TH2 and TH7. No calibration, quality control, resampling or gap-filling has been applied."
